<title>UK: Daiwa Europe appoints debt origination director.</title>
<headline>Daiwa Europe appoints debt origination director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daiwa Europe said in a statement on Friday it had appointed Maria Gripenberg executive director of its debt origination team responsible for coverage of frequent borrowers in Europe. Gripenberg joins from BNP Capital Markets, London where she held a similar brief for selected clients since 1994 and will take up her new position in the second half of November.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
